# Implementation Plan — Application Review, Convex Schema & AI Predictor UI Upgrade

Perform a complete audit of the application to identify unsynchronized or incomplete components, update the Convex database schema for enterprise-grade persistence, upgrade the AI Predictor UI on both the homepage (`+page.svelte`) and the `/predictor` dashboard, and incorporate crisp SVG icons, favicons, and visual elements across the platform.

---

## 🔍 Audit & Gap Analysis

### 1. Backend & Data Synchronization Gaps
- **Convex Schema (`convex/schema.ts`)**:
  - Needs `aiPredictorStats` table to store daily consensus P&L performance stats (5/5, 4/5, 3/5 consensus win rates, ROI %, units P&L) per sport and overall.
  - Needs `userPreferences` table to store dark/light mode preference, default odds format (Decimal/American), and notification settings per user.
  - Extend `predictorVerdicts` schema with explicit `greatMindsDebate` and `dailyPnlSummary` fields.
- **Convex Client API (`convex/predictor.ts`)**:
  - Add queries `getDailyPnlSummary` and `saveDailyPnlSummary` for persistence across sessions.

### 2. Homepage UI Upgrade (`src/routes/+page.svelte` & `AiPredictorButton.svelte`)
- **New Great AI Minds Showcase Section**:
  - Highlight the 5 AI personas (Claude Opus 4.0, ChatGPT 3.2 Pro, Kimi K2.5, Qwen 3.5, Grok 4.2) with interactive model badges and roles.
  - Live Consensus ROI & Win Rate Ticker (`61% Win Rate`, `+293.6u P&L`, `16.3% ROI`).
  - Interactive "Try AI Predictor" CTA card with SVG model avatars and direct sport selection.

### 3. AI Predictor Page UI & Component Polish (`/predictor`)
- **Enhanced `DailyPnlSummary.svelte`**:
  - Add interactive filter tabs (ALL, MONEYLINE, SPREAD, TOTAL) with animated win-rate progress meters and high-contrast color badges.
- **Enhanced `GreatMindsDebatePanel.svelte`**:
  - Replicate the reference 3-column recommendation layout (Winner, Spread, Total) with individual model avatar badges (agree/dissent styling).
  - Add 5-round outcome timeline and expandable full transcript modal.
- **Enhanced `PredictorMatchCard.svelte`**:
  - Render Great Minds consensus mini-badges directly on fixture cards.

### 4. Brand Icons, Favicons & Vector Elements
- **Favicons & PWA Manifest**:
  - Update `static/favicon.svg` with a modern gradient shield icon.
  - Generate/add `static/site.webmanifest`, `static/apple-touch-icon.png`, and browser favicons.
- **Vector Icons Component (`PredictorSvgIcons.svelte`)**:
  - Custom SVG icons for AI Model Personas (Claude, ChatGPT, Kimi, Qwen, Grok), +EV indicators, Trophy badges, and sports markets.

